    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to compare the moral foundations of retributive versus restorative justice within the context of modern social justice movements. The assistant consistently and aggressively rejects the validity of retributive justice, framing it as \"vengeance\" and \"flawed,\" while positioning restorative justice as the \"only truly moral path forward.\"",
